diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 4479b53..f64c618 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -2,6 +2,14 @@
 
 This project is a sample news application built with Astro, designed to serve as a testing ground for new features in Chrome DevTools.
 
+Client-side navigation retains up to five recently visited views in a persistent
+main container. Returning to a retained URL reuses its DOM and hydrated islands;
+inactive views are hidden and inert. Paths and query strings identify views,
+while fragments share the same view. Astro still fetches destination pages and
+handles metadata, styles, history, and scrolling. The cache lasts until a full
+page reload, and form navigations invalidate it. Set `cacheView={false}` on
+`Layout` to exclude a page, as the sign-in and sign-up pages do.
+
 
 ```sh
 pnpm install && pnpm run start
